ext":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"type":"topic","role":"collection","kind":"symbol","title":"Swami"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_PinchView":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Pinch to scale a shape. A magnification (pinch) gesture drives an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"origami.PopSwitch"},{"type":"text","text":" whose"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"state feeds the shape’s Transform Scale ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"builtin.point3D"},{"type":"text","text":"); releasing the pinch “pops” the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"switch to its nearest state with a spring. At rest the shape sits at its base scale on the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"artboard background."}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_PinchView","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_pinchview","kind":"symbol","title":"Interaction_PinchView","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Interaction_PinchView"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Interaction_PinchView"}]}}}